== Trivia ==
* '''The Negative''' allows access to the Dark Room, which is also the name of a room used to develop photos ([[wikipedia:Darkroom|Darkroom]]).
* A [[wikipedia:Negative (photography)|negative]] is a piece of film with an image imprinted on it and developed, and light can be shone through it to imprint a positive image on photographic paper. A negative has inverted hues and luminosity.

